    "synthesis_rationale": "Incorporating a strong positive update from opposition consolidation and turnout, offset by neutral market signals and poll divergence, yields a calibrated posterior around 0.80. The interval accounts for remaining uncertainty in coalition dynamics and turnout effects."
  }
}

